    "detailed_description": "FLOWFALL is a challenging depth perception-based arcade game where you must fit the correct shapes into the correct gates as you fall. On a whim you can swap between 4 different shapes that each have a specific gate. Touch anything and the game is over, how long can you last? Set a high score using the in game timer!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExperience an amazing 15 song synthwave soundtrack! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nA unique concept for the puzzle arcade genre,  fall through 8 different stages and prove you can FLOW!",
